thermofeel's Liljegren module transcribes Liljegren et al. (2008), "Modeling the wet bulb
globe temperature using standard meteorological measurements", J. Occup. Environ. Hyg. 5(10),
https://doi.org/10.1080/15459620802310770, and Kong & Huber (2022).

Weather data: Open-Meteo Historical Weather API (https://open-meteo.com/), based on ERA5
reanalysis; Open-Meteo data are offered under CC BY 4.0.
Day-ahead forecasts: Open-Meteo Previous Runs API (https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/previous-runs-api),
CC BY 4.0. Live forecasts in the browser: Open-Meteo Forecast API, CC BY 4.0.
Air quality: Open-Meteo Air Quality API. Contains modified Copernicus Atmosphere Monitoring
Service information 2025–2026; neither the European Commission nor ECMWF is responsible for any
use of this information.
